---
description: CI stays unsigned and free of noisy scanners
globs: .github/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Do not add CodeQL, Super-Linter, Scorecard, Semgrep, Trivy, or Sonar. Coverage is first-party `./Scripts/coverage.sh` (llvm-cov artifact). No signing secrets. Do not add Dependabot or any other dependency bot.
